: [], "annotations": [], "relations": []}, {"infons": {"name_3": "surname:Naing;given-names:A.", "name_2": "surname:Wheler;given-names:J.", "name_1": "surname:Shi;given-names:N.", "name_0": "surname:Fu;given-names:S.", "fpage": "10", "pub-id_doi": "10.1186/s40661-015-0018-x", "pub-id_pmid": "27231570", "year": "2015", "source": "Gynecol. Oncol. Res. Pract.", "type": "ref", "volume": "2", "section_type": "REF", "name_9": "surname:Zinner;given-names:R.", "name_8": "surname:Tsimberidou;given-names:A.", "name_7": "surname:Hong;given-names:D.", "name_6": "surname:Gong;given-names:J.", "name_5": "surname:Piha-Paul;given-names:S.", "name_4": "surname:Janku;given-names:F."}, "offset": 32954, "text": "Characteristics and outcomes for patients with advanced vaginal or vulvar cancer referred to a phase I clinical trials program: The MD Anderson cancer center experience", "sentences": [], "annotations": [], "relations": []}, {"infons": {"section_type": "FIG", "file": "diagnostics-11-02085-g001.jpg", "id": "diagnostics-11-02085-f001", "type": "fig_caption"}, "offset": 33123, "text": "Histopathological findings: (a) papillary architecture of Bartholin gland carcinoma with necrosis (HE 200x); (b) infiltrating nest of poorly differentiated adenocarcinoma with solid and glandular pattern (HE 200x); (c,d) moderate to severe nuclear atypia with eosinophilic cytoplasm in the papillary and solid architecture (HE 400x).", "sentences": [], "annotations": [{"id": "2499", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D000230", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D000230"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D000230", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Adenocarcinoma", "accession": "@DISEASE_Adenocarcinoma"}, "text": "adenocarcinoma", "locations": [{"offset": 33279, "length": 14}]}, {"id": "2500", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D009336", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D009336"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D009336", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Necrosis", "accession": "@DISEASE_Necrosis"}, "text": "necrosis", "locations": [{"offset": 33212, "length": 8}]}, {"id": "2501", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D000073839", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D000073839"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D000073839", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Trisomy 13 Syndrome", "accession": "@DISEASE_Trisomy_13_Syndrome"}, "text": "Bartholin gland carcinoma", "locations": [{"offset": 33181, "length": 25}]}], "relations": []}, {"infons": {"section_type": "FIG", "file": "diagnostics-11-02085-g002.jpg", "id": "diagnostics-11-02085-f002", "type": "fig_caption"}, "offset": 33460, "text": "PET/CT during disease course: (a) In September 2018, PET/CT showed the appearance of hypermetabolic bilateral lung nodules; (b) the PET/CT scans of April 2019 after 6 months of Nivolumab showed a significant reduction in and disappearance of hypermetabolic activity of the lung lesions; (c,d) PET/CT scan on April 2019 showed stable hypermetabolic activity in the left perineum and vagina and hypermetabolic activity in the right inguinal region; (e-g) in July 2019, imaging showed progression of disease in the lung (e) in comparison to April 2019, as well as the appearance of hypermetabolic areas in the left anterior abdominal wall (f) and in the right inguinal region (g); (h,i) PET/CT imaging on February (h) and May 2020 (i) after 6 and 9 months of treatment with mTOR inhibitor, respectively; (j,k) PET/CT imaging in October 2021 and February 2021 before and after 3 months of treatment with Palbociclib.", "sentences": [], "annotations": [{"id": "2502", "infons": {"identifier": "2475", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "3637", "valid": true, "normalized": [2475], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 2475, "biotype": "gene", "name": "MTOR", "accession": "@GENE_MTOR"}, "text": "mTOR", "locations": [{"offset": 34231, "length": 4}]}, {"id": "2503", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D003074", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D003074"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D003074", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Solitary Pulmonary Nodule", "accession": "@DISEASE_Solitary_Pulmonary_Nodule"}, "text": "lung nodules", "locations": [{"offset": 33570, "length": 12}]}, {"id": "2504", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D000077594", "type": "Chemical", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D000077594"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D000077594", "biotype": "chemical", "name": "Nivolumab", "accession": "@CHEMICAL_Nivolumab"}, "text": "Nivolumab", "locations": [{"offset": 33637, "length": 9}]}, {"id": "2505", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D008171", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D008171"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D008171", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Lung Diseases", "accession": "@DISEASE_Lung_Diseases"}, "text": "lung lesions", "locations": [{"offset": 33733, "length": 12}]}, {"id": "2506", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:C500026", "type": "Chemical", "valid": true, "normalized": ["C500026"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "C500026", "biotype": "chemical", "name": "palbociclib", "accession": "@CHEMICAL_palbociclib"}, "text": "Palbociclib", "locations": [{"offset": 34360, "length": 11}]}], "relations": []}, {"infons": {"section_type": "FIG", "file": "diagnostics-11-02085-g003.jpg", "id": "diagnostics-11-02085-f003", "type": "fig_caption"}, "offset": 34375, "text": "Comprehensive genomic profiling revealed multiple potentially targetable gene amplifications in CCND1, FGF4 and MDM2. Y-axes denote log-ratio measurements of coverage obtained in test samples versus a normal reference sample, with assessed copy numbers marked by dashed lines. Each point denotes a genomic region measured by means of the assay (blue, exon; cyan, SNP), and these are ordered by genomic position. Red lines indicate the average log-ratio in a segment, whereas green lines illustrate the model prediction. Asterisks denote the detected CCND1 (chr11) and MDM2 amplification (chr12).", "sentences": [], "annotations": [{"id": "2507", "infons": {"identifier": "595", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "1334", "valid": true, "normalized": [595], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 595, "biotype": "gene", "name": "CCND1", "accession": "@GENE_CCND1"}, "text": "CCND1", "locations": [{"offset": 34471, "length": 5}]}, {"id": "2508", "infons": {"identifier": "2249", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "1522", "valid": true, "normalized": [2249], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 2249, "biotype": "gene", "name": "FGF4", "accession": "@GENE_FGF4"}, "text": "FGF4", "locations": [{"offset": 34478, "length": 4}]}, {"id": "2509", "infons": {"identifier": "4193", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "1793", "valid": true, "normalized": [4193], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 4193, "biotype": "gene", "name": "MDM2", "accession": "@GENE_MDM2"}, "text": "MDM2", "locations": [{"offset": 34487, "length": 4}]}, {"id": "2510", "infons": {"identifier": "595", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "1334", "valid": true, "normalized": [595], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 595, "biotype": "gene", "name": "CCND1", "accession": "@GENE_CCND1"}, "text": "CCND1", "locations": [{"offset": 34925, "length": 5}]}, {"id": "2511", "infons": {"identifier": "4193", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "1793", "valid": true, "normalized": [4193], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 4193, "biotype": "gene", "name": "MDM2", "accession": "@GENE_MDM2"}, "text": "MDM2", "locations": [{"offset": 34943, "length": 4}]}], "relations": []}, {"infons": {"section_type": "FIG", "file": "diagnostics-11-02085-g004.jpg", "id": "diagnostics-11-02085-f004", "type": "fig_caption"}, "offset": 34971, "text": "Computed tomography imaging in October 2019 and January 2020 during mTOR-inhibitor treatment.", "sentences": [], "annotations": [{"id": "2512", "infons": {"identifier": "2475", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "3637", "valid": true, "normalized": [2